          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "A model of the solar system has caught Nellie, Buzz and Gibbs’ attention at the Science Fair. They explore the model, learning a fun song to remember the order of the planets, before heading into space to take a look at those planets up close. They’ll learn how day and night happens and even hop inside a rocket to see what it’s like for astronauts in space!\n\nBonus Chapter – Design your very own solar system\nwith the BrainBots!",
